    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place</i> or <i>put round, put on</i>, 
